ain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=-1R_3$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nThe matrix is in row echelon form: each pivot lies to the right of the pivot above it, with zeros below each pivot."] [:db/add "3f6d6d3c-66aa-5ed3-977c-1167a733995f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "3f6d6d3c-66aa-5ed3-977c-1167a733995f" :question/answer-fields "81e290af-84ee-5e4b-9c8f-37d0d2c4e5f9"] [:db/ensure "3f6d6d3c-66aa-5ed3-977c-1167a733995f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096672 :knowledge-point/questions "3f6d6d3c-66aa-5ed3-977c-1167a733995f"] [:db/add "d12032ce-4505-530a-8a98-9bca9c88fee2" :answer/id #uuid "d12032ce-4505-530a-8a98-9bca9c88fee2"] [:db/add "d12032ce-4505-530a-8a98-9bca9c88fee2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d12032ce-4505-530a-8a98-9bca9c88fee2" :answer/value "M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "d12032ce-4505-530a-8a98-9bca9c88fee2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "719fde22-4a1a-58fc-8c9d-b7868380de05" :answer/id #uuid "719fde22-4a1a-58fc-8c9d-b7868380de05"] [:db/add "719fde22-4a1a-58fc-8c9d-b7868380de05" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "719fde22-4a1a-58fc-8c9d-b7868380de05" :answer/value "M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "719fde22-4a1a-58fc-8c9d-b7868380de05" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4e4889ca-83da-5ff9-981f-0e41f20189b5" :answer/id #uuid "4e4889ca-83da-5ff9-981f-0e41f20189b5"] [:db/add "4e4889ca-83da-5ff9-981f-0e41f20189b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4e4889ca-83da-5ff9-981f-0e41f20189b5" :answer/value "M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "4e4889ca-83da-5ff9-9