c9b486b809e"] [:db/add "09a1242e-98fe-5da1-a126-dc9b486b809e" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ -2 & -3 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 2 & 4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form."] [:db/add "09a1242e-98fe-5da1-a126-dc9b486b809e" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ -2 & -3 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 2 & 4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_2:=R_2+2R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 2 & 4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3+R_1$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 6\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=\\frac{1}{2}R_3$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nThe matrix is in row echelon form: each pivot lies to the right of the pivot above it, with zeros below each pivot."] [:db/add "09a1242e-98fe-5da1-a126-dc9b486b809e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "09a1242e-98fe-5da1-a126-dc9b486b809e" :question/answer-fields "b28350fd-dfc4-504c-9d39-ebefce9e705b"] [:db/ensure "09a1242e-98fe-5da1-a126-dc9b486b809e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096672 :knowledge-point/questions "09a1242e-98fe-5da1-a126-dc9b486b809e"] [:db/ensure 17592186096672 :knowledge-point/validate]]
